[x] Implement the minimal atomic action transaction =action-transaction ~ $Plan a small ordered batch of action update, complete, and cancel operations against trusted current state and commit all affected files through one existing PendingBatch. GATED ON durable-verbs keystone: build on core with_locked_mutation + relocated ActionUpdate/apply_updates + generalized selector rather than forking the lock->plan->commit envelope. The transact update-action plan and the single update verb share ONE core plan_update_action (durable-verbs defers this reuse call to the action that introduces core update_action); do not duplicate the planner. Result bytes reuse VerbOutcome/VerbError; request set.state terminal values rejected by core in-place terminal-state guard.$ !1 %2026-08-15T19:43 <workflow-schemas #019fdffc-b19f-7062-871f-d1220e0e546c
